 "short_description": "<p>The Corsair CX750 750W PSU is an 80 PLUS Bronze certified power supply delivering 750W of reliable power for gaming PCs and high-performance desktop systems, featuring a 120mm low-noise cooling fan and essential protection features for dependable operation.</p>",
 "description": "<h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"a11z96\" data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1099\">Corsair CX750 750W PSU Price in Pakistan</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1877\">The Corsair CX750 750W PSU is a reliable power supply designed for gaming PCs, workstation builds and demanding desktop systems, delivering 750W of continuous power with 80 PLUS Bronze efficiency for efficient and dependable operation. This Corsair 750W PSU features a single +12V rail, a 120mm low-noise cooling fan and a non-modular cable design, making it a practical choice for users looking for a reliable 750W Bronze PSU or comparing the Corsair CX750 750W price in Pakistan. The CX750 also includes essential protection technologies including Over Voltage Protection, Over Power Protection, Short Circuit Protection and Under Voltage Protection.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Specification</th>\n<th>Details</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Brand</strong></td>\n<td>Corsair</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Model</strong></td>\n<td>CX750</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Power Output</strong></td>\n<td>750W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Efficiency</strong></td>\n<td>80 PLUS Bronze</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Form Factor</strong></td>\n<td>ATX</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Fan Size</strong></td>\n<td>120mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>+12V Rail</strong></td>\n<td>Single Rail</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Modular</strong></td>\n<td>No</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Cooling</strong></td>\n<td>120mm Low-Noise Fan</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Protection</strong></td>\n<td>OVP / OPP / SCP / UVP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Input Voltage</strong></td>\n<td>100–240V</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Warranty</strong></td>\n<td>5 Years</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Condition</strong></td>\n<td>New</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
